### Implementation details (be concrete)
- Define Segment model: start: float, end: float, text: str
- transcript.json should contain list of segments
- translated.json should contain list of segments with translated text
- SRT generator:
  - convert seconds to SRT timestamp format HH:MM:SS,mmm
  - each segment becomes one subtitle block
- Translation strategy:
  - translate per segment but with a small rolling context window (previous 1-2 segments) to keep coherence
  - enforce “spoken natural language” and “similar length” in prompt
  - return ONLY translated text, no extra commentary
- Job execution:
  - When /jobs is called, create job_id (uuid4)
  - Mark status: queued -> running -> succeeded/failed
  - Persist errors into job record and error.txt in output folder
- Must include robust retries for network calls (tenacity) and timeouts.

